  abstract={Artificial Intelligence (AI) is revolutionizing the film industry by automating complex processes in post-production. AI-Generated Content (AIGC) offers innovative solutions for tasks such as video editing, color grading, visual effects, sound design, and compositing. This paper explores the integration of AIGC into post-production workflows, highlighting its potential to increase efficiency, reduce costs, and open creative possibilities. We analyze key technologies, their applications, and case studies demonstrating successful integration. The paper concludes with a discussion of the challenges and future trends in AI-assisted post-production.},
