  abstract={The problem investigated in this paper is how to realize automated pastiche by data intelligence and develop image creation ways. Solving these problems is of great significance for developing image creation methods in intelligent and automated way and improving image reproduction efficiency. The core innovation of this research lies in data analogy association and analysis of image creation by automated pastiche. The image is taken as a system, which analyzes audience data and makes creative decision as agent. Image pastiche is achieved in the system by judging audience aesthetics from big data analysis. From automatic recognition to automatic generation, data intelligent simulation can develop traditional image production techniques or processes, and efficiently reproduce images by pastiche. More efficient image productivity will increase innovative meaning and intelligent labor value of automated pastiche. Compared with previous related research, innovation of this paper lies in: definition of “automated pastiche” is made on the latest technology based on data generation image, and creative value of these technologies is defined from intelligent labor and image creation. This paper demonstrates the future development value of image creation through data intelligence-based automated pastiche by studying intelligent image pastiche.},
