  abstract={As one of the most important service institutions, the hospital is often inefficient, and sometimes hospital will even cause chaos. In addition, the hospital keeps a lot of important network resources, which is very vulnerable to network attacks by illegal elements, such as hackers. Artificial intelligence is one of the three cutting-edge technologies in the 21st century and it has a big potential in many fields which involve the computer science. This article aims to summarize and discuss different ways of introducing artificial intelligence technology into the aspects of hospital work. It will help consider the direction and inspiration of designing an intelligent hospital while protecting the cyber security of the hospital. It discusses the specific methods and application designs in improving the hospital service by analyzing the field of affective computing, computer vision and neural network. In conclusion, the introduction of artificial intelligence can make hospitals have a better treatment process and comfortable work flow.},
