  abstract={Summary <p>Described as a hypothetical yet potent entity, artificial general intelligence (AGI) is envisioned to master any intellectual feat achievable by humans or animals. This chapter delves into AGI's allure, its pathway, and the paradigm it aims to establish. It briefly pivots toward the tangible manifestations of AI advancements&#x2014;humanoid robots, epitomizing the fusion of form and intellect. Harnessing the power of AI through autonomous AI agents heralds a new era in the technological landscape. The chapter discusses some domains where AGI could significantly contribute: extended lifespan, accelerated research, space exploration, climate change mitigation, biodiversity conservation, advanced judicial systems, and safe harnessing of catastrophic technologies. The melding of AI with robotics unveils a realm where machines interact physically, with AI acting as their brain, propelling advancements in autonomous vehicles, industrial automation, and healthcare robotics.</p>},
