  abstract={Artificial intelligence is a big revolution in the field of automation & engineering. Specifically, Computer vision is one of the biggest boons for our upcoming industries. This paper is focused on one of the applications of PC Vision. We humans can read, listen, imagine, visualize, and extract an image out from the conveyed text in our brain and even we can draw it. By using artificial intelligence our evolving machines can also do the same. Videography is a very vast field and as the consumers of smart devices are increasing we know that evolution in the field of videography is also required. By the constant evolution in the field of computer vision using deep learning, our smart devices are capable of portraying images or video from static or dynamic data in the form of text. By using PC Vision we can develop the raw image by organization development of text input. Dynamic components are executed by changing over the data text into an image channel. And the basic methodology of converting is by processing all the available image data on the internet and collecting them in a dataset and then by using deep learning we will correlate it with text data. The troubles are picking key articulations to highlight in the video, removing the meaning of the text, and showing them in a video showing simply the elements and reliably a huge articulation},
